        "excerpt": "<details open>\n\ncommon: pin model resolution on real HF repo layouts (#30548)\n\n* tests: pin model resolution on real repo listings\n\nExtend test-model-resolution with 63 repo listings captured verbatim\nfrom the HF API, chosen to cover every file naming pattern found across\n1237 GGUF repos of the major publishers and pruned to whole quant groups.\nEach repo pins its resolved plans and its cache listing.\n\nThe expectations follow what each file really is per its GGUF header,\nnot what the current resolver picks, so a mismatch is a resolution bug.\nMismatches are collected and reported together before the test fails.\n\n* tests: leave the listing unchecked on paths the filesystem refuses\n\nSome real split names (DevQuasar's Model.Q2_K.gguf-00001-of-00012.gguf\nunder a quant folder) exceed MAX_PATH once materialized in the temporary\ncache on Windows, so the listing of such a repo is skipped with a note\nwhile its plans stay checked.\n\n* tests: pin real listings to master on GGUF convention names only\n\nReplace the real repo table with 171 HF listings whose file names follow\nthe GGUF naming convention (lowercase sidecar prefix, - delimited\ncomponents, quant last), one per layout pattern found acros",
